      "writtenOn": "2026-11-18T01:38:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I checked before changing it. Patch versions are used in @since quite a lot, including on this branch: there are eight `@since 6.10.1` tags (e.g. RevWalk#isMergedIntoAnyCommit in a8efd046f, DiffFormatter, UploadPack), and each has a matching .api_filters entry. `@since 6.10` would also be inaccurate, since get() isn\u0027t in 6.10.0/6.10.1. No filter should be needed here because Optionally is in an x-friends internal package, which the API tools don\u0027t check (.api_filters has no entries for internal packages). So I\u0027ve left it as 6.10.2. If you\u0027d rather drop the tag entirely, since it\u0027s internal, I\u0027m happy to do that.",
